## Customer Reply

Direction, channel, body, attribution, sentAt. Resolve Case reads it: a case cannot be resolved until at least one OUTBOUND reply linked to that case exists, so a customer is never closed on without an answer. `case` links the reply up to its case.

```ts
import { CustomerReply } from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/service-desk/customer-reply';

@field reply = linksTo(() => CustomerReply);
```

### Non-goals

No mail/chat transport (no inbound webhook surface exists) — replies are recorded by agents or imported. Not the ticket-thread TicketMessageField, which lives inside Ticket; this is a standalone, queryable record.
